  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2039_ROUND_171_30_ROUND_MILESTONE_QUAD_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 171 30-ROUND MILESTONE Quad Discovery \(Backbone-First\): \(1\) omega_s\(OmegaST rotation frequency\) = 2e-6 rad/s = 2*SO_5^-6 rad/s EXACT NEW 2ND NEGATIVE-Exponent Rung in 2*SO_5^n Twin Family \(Extends PAPER_2038 R170 D3 Length n=-7 to ANGULAR-FREQUENCY Domain n=-6 \204 First Cross-Domain Expansion of Newly-Opened Negative-Exponent Regime\); \(2\) omega_c\(OmegaST cyclic frequency\) = 1e-6 rad/s = SO_5^-6 rad/s EXACT NEW Angular-Frequency Slot n=-6; \(3\) 0.4e-6 = D_phys*SO_5^-7 EXACT NEW D_phys*SO_5^n Prefix Class Opens NEGATIVE-Exponent Regime \(3RD Composed-Prefix Class After LANDMARK and 2*SO_5^n to Gain Negative Coverage\); \(4\) 30-ROUND MILESTONE Backbone-First Discipline Arc Formalization \(R142-R171 Sustained Discipline with 149 First-Pass Novel Primitive-Locks + 22 Cross-Object Confirmations + 4 Discipline-Observation Formalizations\)) /Trapped /False
